{
  "schema": 1,
  "description": "Stage 11 of the Core Updater (#4038, sub-slice 9f): each enabled GeoIP continent's IPv4 and IPv6 set, the concatenation of its selected countries' lists in the country folder. Frozen through today's continent block of sync_package_pfblockerng() (src/usr/local/pkg/pfblockerng/pfblockerng_apply.inc:3471-3661) by tests/php/GeoipContinentSetCorpusTest.php, and run through go/pfb_core/update (geosets.go). A case's files are every file under the list folders afterwards (original, deny, permit, match, native), absent ones left out; changed lists the sets rebuilt, in the order they were built; log the 'Could not open ISO' lines. old_expect is today's answer where Core departs from it, with the departure named. Aggregation is off in every case: ipset.CIDRAggregate has its own corpus.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "a-country-builds-its-continent-set",
      "description": "One selected country: the set is its list, published as the baseline (.orig) and the list (.txt) in the folder of the continent's action.",
      "groups": [{"name": "pfB_Africa", "action": "Deny_Inbound", "listClass": "deny", "countriesV4": ["ZA"], "countriesV6": []}],
      "cc": {"ZA_v4.txt": "41.0.0.0/11\n102.0.0.0/8\n"},
      "expect": {
        "files": {"original/pfB_Africa_v4.orig": "41.0.0.0/11\n102.0.0.0/8\n", "deny/pfB_Africa_v4.txt": "41.0.0.0/11\n102.0.0.0/8\n"},
        "changed": ["pfB_Africa_v4"],
        "log": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "countries-in-selection-order",
      "description": "Countries are concatenated in the order the continent selects them, not sorted.",
      "groups": [{"name": "pfB_Europe", "action": "Deny_Both", "listClass": "deny", "countriesV4": ["FR", "DE"], "countriesV6": []}],
      "cc": {"DE_v4.txt": "5.0.0.0/16\n", "FR_v4.txt": "2.0.0.0/12\n"},
      "expect": {
        "files": {"original/pfB_Europe_v4.orig": "2.0.0.0/12\n5.0.0.0/16\n", "deny/pfB_Europe_v4.txt": "2.0.0.0/12\n5.0.0.0/16\n"},
        "changed": ["pfB_Europe_v4"],
        "log": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "both-families",
      "description": "The IPv4 set reads the countries' _v4 lists and the IPv6 set their _v6 lists; IPv4 is built first.",
      "groups": [{"name": "pfB_NAmerica", "action": "Deny_Inbound", "listClass": "deny", "countriesV4": ["US"], "countriesV6": ["US"]}],
      "cc": {"US_v4.txt": "3.0.0.0/8\n", "US_v6.txt": "2600::/12\n"},
      "expect": {
        "files": {
          "original/pfB_NAmerica_v4.orig": "3.0.0.0/8\n", "deny/pfB_NAmerica_v4.txt": "3.0.0.0/8\n",
          "original/pfB_NAmerica_v6.orig": "2600::/12\n", "deny/pfB_NAmerica_v6.txt": "2600::/12\n"
        },
        "changed": ["pfB_NAmerica_v4", "pfB_NAmerica_v6"],
        "log": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "an-unchanged-set-is-left-as-it-is",
      "description": "A set equal to its baseline, with its list in place and equal to it, is not rebuilt.",
      "groups": [{"name": "pfB_Africa", "action": "Deny_Inbound", "listClass": "deny", "countriesV4": ["ZA"], "countriesV6": []}],
      "cc": {"ZA_v4.txt": "41.0.0.0/11\n"},
      "before": {"original/pfB_Africa_v4.orig": "41.0.0.0/11\n", "deny/pfB_Africa_v4.txt": "41.0.0.0/11\n"},
      "expect": {
        "files": {"original/pfB_Africa_v4.orig": "41.0.0.0/11\n", "deny/pfB_Africa_v4.txt": "41.0.0.0/11\n"},
        "changed": [],
        "log": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-list-that-differs-from-its-baseline-is-rebuilt",
      "description": "A set equal to its baseline whose list holds something else (a run killed between publishing the list and its baseline, then the country data back to the baseline) is rebuilt, so the list heals.",
      "groups": [{"name": "pfB_Africa", "action": "Deny_Inbound", "listClass": "deny", "countriesV4": ["ZA"], "countriesV6": []}],
      "cc": {"ZA_v4.txt": "41.0.0.0/11\n"},
      "before": {"original/pfB_Africa_v4.orig": "41.0.0.0/11\n", "deny/pfB_Africa_v4.txt": "102.0.0.0/8\n"},
      "expect": {
        "files": {"original/pfB_Africa_v4.orig": "41.0.0.0/11\n", "deny/pfB_Africa_v4.txt": "41.0.0.0/11\n"},
        "changed": ["pfB_Africa_v4"],
        "log": []
      },
      "old_expect": {
        "files": {"original/pfB_Africa_v4.orig": "41.0.0.0/11\n", "deny/pfB_Africa_v4.txt": "102.0.0.0/8\n"},
        "changed": [],
        "log": []
      },
      "departure": "Core compares the published list with the set as well as the baseline: today's PHP compares only the baseline, so a list left behind by an interrupted publication stays until the country data changes."
    },
    {
      "id": "a-changed-set-replaces-baseline-and-list",
      "description": "A set that differs from its baseline replaces the baseline and the list.",
      "groups": [{"name": "pfB_Africa", "action": "Deny_Inbound", "listClass": "deny", "countriesV4": ["ZA"], "countriesV6": []}],
      "cc": {"ZA_v4.txt": "41.0.0.0/11\n"},
      "before": {"original/pfB_Africa_v4.orig": "41.0.0.0/12\n", "deny/pfB_Africa_v4.txt": "41.0.0.0/12\n"},
      "expect": {
        "files": {"original/pfB_Africa_v4.orig": "41.0.0.0/11\n", "deny/pfB_Africa_v4.txt": "41.0.0.0/11\n"},
        "changed": ["pfB_Africa_v4"],
        "log": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-missing-list-rebuilds-the-set",
      "description": "A set equal to its baseline whose list is gone is rebuilt.",
      "groups": [{"name": "pfB_Africa", "action": "Deny_Inbound", "listClass": "deny", "countriesV4": ["ZA"], "countriesV6": []}],
      "cc": {"ZA_v4.txt": "41.0.0.0/11\n"},
      "before": {"original/pfB_Africa_v4.orig": "41.0.0.0/11\n"},
      "expect": {
        "files": {"original/pfB_Africa_v4.orig": "41.0.0.0/11\n", "deny/pfB_Africa_v4.txt": "41.0.0.0/11\n"},
        "changed": ["pfB_Africa_v4"],
        "log": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-geoip-change-rebuilds-an-unchanged-set",
      "description": "After a GeoIP conversion changed the country lists (today's geoip.update marker), every set is rebuilt, even one equal to its baseline.",
      "groups": [{"name": "pfB_Africa", "action": "Deny_Inbound", "listClass": "deny", "countriesV4": ["ZA"], "countriesV6": []}],
      "cc": {"ZA_v4.txt": "41.0.0.0/11\n"},
      "before": {"original/pfB_Africa_v4.orig": "41.0.0.0/11\n", "deny/pfB_Africa_v4.txt": "kept\n"},
      "geoipChanged": true,
      "expect": {
        "files": {"original/pfB_Africa_v4.orig": "41.0.0.0/11\n", "deny/pfB_Africa_v4.txt": "41.0.0.0/11\n"},
        "changed": ["pfB_Africa_v4"],
        "log": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-forced-reload-rebuilds-an-unchanged-set",
      "description": "A forced reload (today's reuse switch) rebuilds a set equal to its baseline.",
      "groups": [{"name": "pfB_Africa", "action": "Deny_Inbound", "listClass": "deny", "countriesV4": ["ZA"], "countriesV6": []}],
      "cc": {"ZA_v4.txt": "41.0.0.0/11\n"},
      "before": {"original/pfB_Africa_v4.orig": "41.0.0.0/11\n", "deny/pfB_Africa_v4.txt": "kept\n"},
      "force": true,
      "expect": {
        "files": {"original/pfB_Africa_v4.orig": "41.0.0.0/11\n", "deny/pfB_Africa_v4.txt": "41.0.0.0/11\n"},
        "changed": ["pfB_Africa_v4"],
        "log": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-missing-country-list-is-logged-and-skipped",
      "description": "A selected country without a list is logged and contributes nothing; the others still build the set.",
      "groups": [{"name": "pfB_Africa", "action": "Deny_Inbound", "listClass": "deny", "countriesV4": ["ZA", "XX"], "countriesV6": []}],
      "cc": {"ZA_v4.txt": "41.0.0.0/11\n"},
      "expect": {
        "files": {"original/pfB_Africa_v4.orig": "41.0.0.0/11\n", "deny/pfB_Africa_v4.txt": "41.0.0.0/11\n"},
        "changed": ["pfB_Africa_v4"],
        "log": ["Could not open ISO [ XX_v4 ]"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "an-ipv4-set-without-networks-is-empty",
      "description": "A continent whose countries hold no networks builds an empty set.",
      "groups": [{"name": "pfB_Africa", "action": "Deny_Inbound", "listClass": "deny", "countriesV4": ["XX"], "countriesV6": []}],
      "cc": {},
      "expect": {
        "files": {"original/pfB_Africa_v4.orig": "", "deny/pfB_Africa_v4.txt": ""},
        "changed": ["pfB_Africa_v4"],
        "log": ["Could not open ISO [ XX_v4 ]"]
      },
      "old_expect": {
        "files": {"original/pfB_Africa_v4.orig": "", "deny/pfB_Africa_v4.txt": "127.1.7.7\n"},
        "changed": ["pfB_Africa_v4"],
        "log": ["Could not open ISO [ XX_v4 ]"]
      },
      "departure": "Core writes no placeholder address into an empty set: docs/specs/go-updater-pipeline.md section 7 makes an empty set a valid desired state and the placeholder an Outpost detail (#4038, owner question 1)."
    },
    {
      "id": "an-ipv6-set-without-networks-is-empty",
      "description": "The same for IPv6, where today's placeholder is the IPv4 placeholder behind '::'.",
      "groups": [{"name": "pfB_Asia", "action": "Deny_Inbound", "listClass": "deny", "countriesV4": [], "countriesV6": ["XX"]}],
      "cc": {},
      "expect": {
        "files": {"original/pfB_Asia_v6.orig": "", "deny/pfB_Asia_v6.txt": ""},
        "changed": ["pfB_Asia_v6"],
        "log": ["Could not open ISO [ XX_v6 ]"]
      },
      "old_expect": {
        "files": {"original/pfB_Asia_v6.orig": "", "deny/pfB_Asia_v6.txt": "::127.1.7.7\n"},
        "changed": ["pfB_Asia_v6"],
        "log": ["Could not open ISO [ XX_v6 ]"]
      },
      "departure": "Core writes no placeholder address into an empty set (docs/specs/go-updater-pipeline.md section 7; #4038, owner question 1)."
    },
    {
      "id": "a-set-of-comments-only-is-kept-as-it-is",
      "description": "Lines that are not networks are carried as they are: the canonical set of the publication (#4038, 9h) leaves them out.",
